    {
      "name": "Programmed to Serve",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor17It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>Every Servitor has a pre-programed task to perform. They will continue to operate on their programmed functions until re-programmed with a Hard (−20) Tech (Augmetics) Test. The individual that programmed (or re-programmed) the Servitor can give it simple orders.  Dual Attack Mode: Instead of attacking normally with the Pneumatic Piston Launcher, the Suppression Servitor may chose to make one of the following attacks: · Area Burst: The Servitor raises its launcher and fires a burst into the ground, knocking opponents back. The Servitor does not roll to attack, anyone within Immediate Range must make a Challenging (+0) Agility test or take 5 damage. Medium sized targets and smaller are also knocked away into Short range and are now Prone. · Focused Strike: The Servitor aims its launcher at a single target, and discharges the entire pneumatic ahrge into their chest. The servitor makes a normal melee attack. If it hits, it deals 10 damage with Penetrating (2). Large sized targets and smaller are knocked away into Medium range and are now Prone.</p>"
        },
